  "description": "* (Disclaimer: The content in this video is intended for educational and informational purposes only)\nDallas, Texas — On July 27, 2025, at approximately 2:15 a.m., Dallas police officers were working in a uniformed, off-duty capacity, in the 10700 block of Finnell Street, when they heard a gunshot. The preliminary investigation determined that 23-year-old Bryan Cruz-Campos was fighting with a man in the parking lot, when Cruz-Campos fired a handgun, grazing the man on the face. Officers went toward the sound of the gunshot and saw the two men fighting. The officer observed Cruz-Campos with a gun in his hand and gave loud verbal commands for Cruz-Campos to drop the gun. Cruz-Campos ignored the officer’s command and ran away. The officer broadcasted Cruz-Campos’ description over his police radio. Officer Keenen Anderson encountered Cruz-Campos, who was still holding the handgun. Officer Anderson gave Cruz-Campos multiple, loud verbal commands to drop the gun. \n\nCruz-Campos ignored Officer Anderson’s command, turned, and lifted the gun. Officer Anderson fired one round, hitting Cruz-Campos in the right shoulder. Cruz-Campos ran through the parking lot and across Finnell Street as Officer Anderson chased him, and while running, Cruz-Campos dropped the gun on the ground. Cruz-Campos moved towards the handgun and Officer Anderson fired one round, missing Cruz-Campos. Cruz-Campos made another motion towards the handgun. Officer Anderson kicked the gun away and tried to take Cruz-Campos into custody as a cover officer arrived to assist. Cruz-Campos attempted to run and was tazed by Officer Anderson to gain compliance.  The cover officer then applied a tourniquet to Cruz-Campos’ arm. Dallas Fire Rescue arrived and transported Mr. Cruz to a local hospital in stable condition. Cruz-Campos’ is charged with aggravated assault and evading arrest. No officers were injured during this incident.\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nSpecial thanks to Shout-Out Supporters on Patreon:\n- 'DIY Solar Power with Will Prowse'\n- Bryan Wilson\n- Bagpiper Joshua Agee\n- thomas\n- 'PrussianBlue'\n- Cody Stephens\n- Daniel G\n- David, Guershom\n- 'K9 Kampers with Alfredo'\n- Troy Polansky\n- Tulla Belle\n- 'quadrakyiro'\n- Scott Mackin\n- \"John B. GunsSaveLife\"\n- david wallace\n- '10izshoe'\n- 'DerLitti86'\n- Brice Danos\n- 'PhlyDaily'\n- Brandon M.\n- Jesse\n- Jeff Short\n- RayJayOB\n- Sean Sheldon\n- Josef Rex\n- 'Jun'\n- 'Xenik'\n- 'GotsNoGroove Cheryl'\n- James Pringle\n- Kelly Goodwin\n- 'Dawesenm'\n- 'Brother.Legal'\n- Paul Rohrbaugh\n- Zach Williams\n- Michael R Sheffield\n- Rich Biggs\n- 'AccuShoot.com'\n- Lisa Overly\n- 'Necko'\n- Gerardo Flores\n- 'coco Coco'\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nSupport us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/PoliceActivity\nFollow us on X: https://x.com/Police_Activity\n\n- Links to the Best Dash Cams you can buy.\nViofo A229 Pro 4K HDR: https://amzn.to/4dYwN2b\nGarmin Mini 3 1080p: https://amzn.to/41hmktx\nVantrue N5 2.7K: https://amzn.to/4dYxgBt\nNexar Pro 1080p: https://amzn.to/3TpyL3y\nThinkware X1000 2K: https://amzn.to/3Bby9Ij\nBlackVue DR970X 4K: https://amzn.to/3Zl7Fy3\n\n🛍️ Check out our Amazon store: https://www.amazon.com/shop/PoliceActivity 🛍️\n\nDisclosure: Please note that we will receive a small commission from purchases made through our Amazon store. This is at no cost to you. It helps support our channel and allows us to continue creating content for you. Your support is highly appreciated!\n\nTimestamps:\n0:00 - Bodycam: Sgt. Gunter\n2:25 - Bodycam: Officer Anderson\n6:54 - Patreon Supporters",
